Z||000004||Shiner||06-02-2000||04:15 AM||||Oreif,<BR> I couldn't see the picture very well; could you make it bigger next time?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P> What I am really concerned with is how the seats look after you log some hours on them.  Do they start to sag and crack?  <P> I really like the GT style covers he makes, but I have a tan interior, and I think it might look poo-poo-rific in my car.  I hate that dog feces colored brown.  Yuck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
